### 2. Файл pubspec.yaml

Не забудьте добавить зависимости для HTTP:
yaml name: weight_loss_app description: A Flutter application for tracking weight loss. environment: sdk: ">=2.12.0 <3.0.0" dependencies: flutter: sdk: flutter http: ^0.13.3 flutter: uses-material-design: true

### 3. README.md

Создайте файл README.md для описания вашего проекта:
markdown # Weight Loss Tracker A simple Flutter application for tracking weight loss goals. ## Features - Track your current weight and weight loss goal. - Log food intake. - Monitor progress with a linear progress indicator. ## Installation 1. Clone the repository: `bash git clone https://github.com/your-username/weight_loss_app.git cd weight_loss_app

2. Install dependencies:
bash flutter pub get

3. Run the application:
bash flutter run

## Backend

Optionally, you can create a backend using Flask to store food logs. See api.py file in the backend folder (if you create one) for the API structure.

